    <briefdescription>
<para>Per-mesh scratch reused across <ref refid="namespaceNeoFOAM_1a6cbdfd4b2fffd39d6929b34f32cb586f" kindref="member">bound()</ref> calls. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>The per-cell sum of face areas is a function of the MESH only, so it is built once and reused for every field bounded on that mesh. Hold one of these next to the fields being bounded; a single cache serves every field on the same mesh. </para>
